---
/**
 * Componente mostrado cuando la subida de fotos está cerrada / el evento ha concluido.
 */
---

<div class="w-full max-w-sm mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center space-y-6 animate-fade-in">
    <!-- Icono central brillante estilo Gala -->
    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-500/30 to-amber-300/10 blur-xl"></div>
        <div class="relative w-28 h-28 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-500/20 via-amber-400/10 to-transparent p-[1.5px] border border-amber-400/30 flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xl shadow-amber-500/10">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-full bg-neutral-950/90 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-amber-400">
                <!-- Icono de cámara con destello / corazón -->
                <svg class="w-11 h-11 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.827 6.175A2.31 2.31 0 015.186 7.23c-.38.054-.757.112-1.134.175C2.999 7.58 2.25 8.507 2.25 9.574V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h15A2.25 2.25 0 0021.75 18V9.574c0-1.067-.75-1.994-1.802-2.169a47.865 47.865 0 00-1.134-.175 2.31 2.31 0 01-1.64-1.055l-.822-1.316a2.192 2.192 0 00-1.736-1.039 48.774 48.774 0 00-5.232 0 2.192 2.192 0 00-1.736 1.039l-.821 1.316z" />
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 12.75a4.5 4.5 0 11-9 0 4.5 4.5 0 019 0zM18.75 10.5h.008v.008h-.008V10.5z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Insignia flotante con destello -->
        <span class="absolute -bottom-1 bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-md shadow-amber-400/20">
            Concluido
        </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Título y mensaje de agradecimiento -->
    <div class="space-y-2.5 px-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
            ¡Gracias por participar!
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[300px] mx-auto">
            La recepción de fotos para el muro en vivo ha finalizado. Agradecemos a todos los invitados que compartieron sus mejores recuerdos de esta velada especial.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjeta informativa y botón de acceso al muro -->
    <div class="w-full bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-800/80 rounded-2xl p-5 backdrop-blur-sm space-y-4 shadow-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-300">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09zM18.259 8.715L18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 002.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 002.456 2.456L21.75 6l-1.035.259a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.456 2.456zM16.894 20.567L16.5 21.75l-.394-1.183a2.25 2.25 0 00-1.423-1.423L13.5 18.75l1.183-.394a2.25 2.25 0 001.423-1.423l.394-1.183.394 1.183a2.25 2.25 0 001.423 1.423l1.183.394-1.183.394a2.25 2.25 0 00-1.423 1.423z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Revive los momentos de la gala</span>
        </div>
        
        <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 leading-normal">
            Puedes consultar en cualquier momento la galería de fotografías proyectadas en pantalla durante el evento.
        </p>

        <a
            href="/wall"
            class="w-full py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-400 to-amber-500 hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95 text-neutral-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition shadow-lg shadow-amber-400/10 cursor-pointer"
        >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-neutral-950" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15.75l5.159-5.159a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l5.159 5.159m-1.5-1.5l1.409-1.409a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l2.909 2.909m-18 3.75h16.5a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5V6a1.5 1.5 0 00-1.5-1.5H3.75A1.5 1.5 0 002.25 6v12a1.5 1.5 0 001.5 1.5zm10.5-11.25h.008v.008h-.008V8.25zm.375 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Ver Muro en Vivo</span>
        </a>

        <a
            href="/api/download/zip"
            download="gala-fotos-aprobadas.zip"
            class="w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700/60 active:scale-95 text-neutral-200 font-semibold text-xs tracking-wide flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition cursor-pointer"
        >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75V16.5M16.5 12L12 16.5m0 0L7.5 12m4.5 4.5V3" />
            </svg>
            <span>Descargar Fotos (ZIP)</span>
        </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Indicador de protección del almacenamiento -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-neutral-400">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-neutral-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 10-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Subida de fotos deshabilitada</span>
    </div>
</div>
